WEBVTT

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:14.510
A broadcast sends one approved WhatsApp template to many contacts at once. Before you start, make sure a WhatsApp Business number is connected through Meta, your template is approved, and your Eazybe wallet has balance.

00:00:15.010 --> 00:00:25.640
From the Broadcasts page, click New broadcast in the top right corner. Eazybe opens the Create broadcast page, where you'll set everything up in three quick steps.

00:00:26.140 --> 00:00:38.660
First, give your broadcast a name — only your team sees it. Pick the number to send from, choose an approved template, and check the Message preview on the right to see exactly what recipients will get.

00:00:39.160 --> 00:00:50.150
Next, choose who receives it. Upload a CSV or Excel list, or switch to the HubSpot contact list tab to pick a synced list — duplicate phone numbers are removed automatically.

00:00:50.650 --> 00:01:06.700
Select your contacts, then check the footer: it shows the recipient count, the sending number, the template, and the Estimated cost. When everything looks right, click Send broadcast — sending uses wallet balance, and you can't recall a campaign once it's out.

00:01:07.200 --> 00:01:16.100
And that's it — your campaign is on its way. Head back to the Broadcasts page to watch delivery, and click View Analytics for recipient-level results.
